             "68969ff3-6ec3-420e-b118-0db6e1286d6a"], Cell["This alternative \
uses the geometry, material, study, and composite-case input fields. \
reinforcementCases defines each physical diameter and spacing; R derives its \
steel area, ratio, and layer position using the fixed clearCoverMm. compositeCase \
remains disabled. R evaluates the complete P-M \
interaction family for both shotcrete thicknesses. The workbook does not \
select a final reinforcement.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
             "01110577-e335-d45a-7d96-2a80c6e93f46"], 
           Cell[BoxData[TagBox[GridBox[{{ItemBox[StyleBox["\"Input\"", 
                   GrayLevel[1], Bold, StripOnInput -> False], Background -> 
